Z||000002||Bob Englert||05-30-2001||07:13 PM||||I suspect the reason you haven't gotten any posts is because there IS NO bolt in engine options for the 2.5L engine.  Any other engine you might want to install will involve wiring changes, mount changes, and possibly clutch and/or shift cable changes.<P>The 3.1 or 3.4 can almost bolt into the V6 Fieros because the castings and general arrangement of the engine is almost identical to that of the 2.8.  I don't think any other 4 cyl engines shared the same basic layout of the Duke to provide a good basis for a simple swap.<P>Good luck with your engine project...<BR><P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
